  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.SurrealDBOASIS v2.0.3\n\nSurrealDB OASIS Provider — multi-model database (document + graph + relational) for OASIS holons and avatars via SurrealDb.Net SDK. https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.2\n- Add bounded SurrealDB CQL admission and correct provider lifecycle state (a8ce52e)\n- Integrate verified SurrealDB GUID reads and avatar-detail serialization (362c6f5)\n- MOVING DOCS AROUND (32a8004)\n- Validate GUID native keys before avatar deletion in forty adapters (597758b)\n- Verify authenticated SurrealDB native persistence and correct save ownership (b5c0a65)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Storage/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.SurrealDBOASIS",
